DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: billion supplemental funds.

1985
01:59:41,080 --> 01:59:43,080
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Of the total

1986
01:59:43,080 --> 01:59:45,080
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: is 5 billion. And of

1987
