1988
01:59:50,000 --> 01:59:52,520
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: For the financial assistance po,

1989
01:59:52,520 --> 01:59:54,760
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: we have 281

1990
01:59:54,760 --> 01:59:56,240
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: million. For the

1991
