1996
02:00:07,960 --> 02:00:15,040
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Sir, actually po, nag-double po ito from our current po na or previous po namin na assistance.

1997
02:00:15,600 --> 02:00:16,380
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, yun sir.

1998
02:00:17,040 --> 02:00:24,640
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then for the standby action fund po, normally po, binibigay na po natin yan sa mga migrant workers offices po natin,

1999
02:00:24,640 --> 02:00:29,960
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: particularly in the Middle East, it's already P845 million.

2000
02:00:30,980 --> 02:00:39,160
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And dun po sa legal assistance po natin, I mentioned that's P702 million.

2001
02:00:39,620 --> 02:00:43,680
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then administrative expenses po, mga P1 million mahigit lang po.

2002
02:00:44,400 --> 02:00:53,300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then we also have P888 million, just downloaded naman po sa ating mga regional offices.

2003
02:00:53,720 --> 02:00:54,620
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Thank you, Your Honor.

2004
02:00:54,640 --> 02:00:55,100
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Thank you, Your Honors.

2005
02:00:55,100 --> 02:01:07,400
