2006
02:01:07,680 --> 02:01:16,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung binanggit natin kanina, yung repatriation, medical or legal, meron pang ibang ginagastusan, other forms?

2007
02:01:16,260 --> 02:01:24,960
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Yun pong financial assistance, Mr. Senator, which pertains to yung on-site, katulad ng mga hindi na-away na nabawasan ng take-home pay,

2008
02:01:25,100 --> 02:01:27,920
