2009
02:01:28,440 --> 02:01:36,060
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then yung mga nauwi po na distressed, na wala pong kapera-pera, yung pong mga deported from the U.S. cruise ships,

2010
02:01:36,620 --> 02:01:42,780
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: yun po ang tulong na binibigay, yung mga na-hostage sa Red Sea, yun po, pagbalik, pag-uwi po nila sa mga distressed.

2011
02:01:43,620 --> 02:01:44,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you.

2012
02:01:44,760 --> 02:01:49,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anyway, thank you, Senator Joel, thank you, Secretary Hans.

2013
02:01:49,020 --> 02:01:53,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anyway, may rest assured that we will do our best to...

2014
02:01:54,180 --> 02:01:55,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because this...

2015
02:01:55,100 --> 02:01:58,420
